\nUses register_options to set default port values rather than DefaultOptions which has been commented out.", "created_at": "2022-06-06T16:40:35Z", "repo": "TA-GenCyber-UML-2022", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "27262aa7db64bcf53b97f21011ffb84a5d0135c2", "message": "Updated DOS\n\nUpdated DOS to be an Auxiliary module, also made it so it would count down (6 seconds) to send the message that will crash the server.\r\n\r\nFor this to work in Armitage it should be located in the Auxiliary module folder rather than the Exploit folder \r\n\r\nTested in Metasploit Consol and Armitage and it does work, since it is not an exploit it won't show up in attacks when the system is scanned (This is as far as I can tell I could be wrong).", "created_at": "2022-06-02T17:30:22Z", "repo": "TA-GenCyber-UML-2022", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42461bbc034c8147d549f76f4bfb5be62a234ad0", "message": "Create DDOS.rb", "created_at": "2022-06-01T20:29:35Z", "repo": "TA-GenCyber-UML-2022", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4485c44c9d540bbb86b84f61f09fc5c0fb903ec1", "message": "Base File for DOS\n\nThis is the base file, I will hopefully improve it soon. A lot can be removed once it is changed to inherit from an Auxilary rather than the exploit class.", "created_at": "2022-06-01T20:28:01Z", "repo": "TA-GenCyber-UML-2022", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "02d0cd95b1397d7f20bcd5241262f9dd44620bc7", "message": "Typo Fix", "created_at": "2023-11-30T16:04:03Z", "repo": "Making-Dos-DDoS-Metasploit-Module-Vulnserver", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5183754d0319c5839c38503deb5f73c96720dcc1", "message": "Small DOSE and DDOSE Update", "created_at": "2023-11-30T15:41:46Z", "repo": "Making-Dos-DDoS-Metasploit-Module-Vulnserver", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, 